        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Thanks for the quick reply!\r\nI finally found the problem: I had the `v` key remapped to incremental selection (with `nvim-treesitter/nvim-treesitter-textobjects`). When I changed this keymap, it fixed the issue.",
